\loch\af2\dbch\af2\hich\f2\strike0\ulnone\cf2   In the weeks since, censors have begun to fine-tune their approach. Some broad keywords, like ''tennis,'' have been restored in searches. Still, Mr. Xiao said, the wide gulf between what can be said outside China and what can be said inside the country could continue to plague attempts to control the topic.}
